      "settings": {
        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Ball Back Studs",
        "text": "<p>Experience everyday elegance with our Ball Back Studs Collection, created for comfort, style, and versatility. Crafted from high quality materials including titanium, surgical steel, and sterling silver, each piece is designed to provide a secure fit and smooth finish for effortless wear all day long.</p><p>Our ball back studs feature a rounded back design that sits comfortably against the skin, making them ideal for cartilage, lobe, tragus, and helix piercings. Choose from plain, polished styles or stone set designs to match your individual look.</p><p>Perfect for those who love dainty, minimalist jewellery that blends modern style with practical comfort, these studs offer a timeless option for any piercing collection.</p>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "center"
